<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-20T13:43:44.245Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:43:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have installed a caretaker administration in Tigray and are moving toward the Eritrean border, while a pro-government militia says it has seized the regional airport and reports Eritrean forces suffered losses there. The United States, through Secretary of State Marco Rubio, is urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate the fighting. Mekelle mayor Shishay Amare announced elections will be held within six months and that Western Tigray will be settled through constitutional processes. Meanwhile, a drone strike in the disputed Abyei region killed at least 73 people, and the TPLF claims to have killed 1,511 Ethiopian soldiers in recent fighting. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPYzc4eGhhbVcyRThCeERPcDZwc1lCU3cyeEJuWEIxMDktdjFGNXdna0xRQ3BhQ05BVVhPaG5xSG92MWtKVjJvLWFGS0ZCMEk1bVhMZFZIcGdncVkxeFhMZEJocmxfTGN1a2V3by05RHBsOTBBTlFDTng2ZFNodFVXNWhWbnctRG5falBtdkVINWlwVDJIYndpRmh4Q2NXWWxB?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPbU9EcDJQTnRNZjl6cnpwQ0sxSVRWc2NrTV9laF9mcEU4YjE4anpTcW0xclgyTlBCbnZYZ1JQY1hzSjRrdHo3RHRSVFJ4Nl80dmRMUkQta042cXpQcjNPU1pKSU10a1ZDQmpPOUczN2F6NGpYZGJtRUM5VDRDcU1Tb2owRTg2UV9NNmJiRnhHY0hmQk5mQk0tYUpqOHdlWnllb1FlQ2JMeFUwdEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE9vSVBSWjJMX1hFVHZPcmNiOW5uREpxZUJJci1yQVdrWmpOWDBIMVY5aXVNVzR3MV9PRzJqUl9hME5jcHNVVzBZQmhkZGlWcERhTEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOZFpoWkctMk9jY2wwajN5NTdXQUNpWE